  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deepening Democracy  Programme (DDP) - Deepening Dem Pr, DDP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rdjupad demokrati (DDP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rdjupad demokrati (DDP) har utvecklats av givare     inom ramen f&#xf6;r den struktur f&#xf6;r givarharmonisering som finns i        Uganda. DDP har fem komponenter dvs. st&#xf6;d till valen, parlamentet,    politiska partier, folkligt engagemang (med fokus p&#xe5;                  v&#xe4;ljarutbildning) och media. Givare &#xe4;r DfID, Irland, Norge, Danmark,  Nederl&#xe4;nderna och Sverige. Total kostnad &#xe4;r 32 MUSD.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Deepening Democracy Programme (DDP) is a programme developed by   donors under the Partners for Democracy and Governance (PDG)-donor    coordination in Uganda. DDP has 5 copmponents eg. support to          elections, parliament, political parties, civic engagement and media. Donors are: DfID, Ireland, Norway, Denmark, Netherlands and Sweden.   The total cost is 32 MUSD.</narrative>
  </description>
